OL,3,GNEWSAWork to upgrade college facilities
OL,4,Aset to take place                      
OL,6,FWork to develop facilities across three
OL,7,Fcampuses at Leicester College is set to
OL,8,Ftake place after government funding was
OL,9,Fsecured.                               
OL,11,FLeicester College said it had received 
OL,12,F#1.66 million from the Office for      
OL,13,FStudents (OfS) to invest in higher     
OL,14,Feducation facilities across its Abbey  
OL,15,FPark, Freemen's Park and St Margaret's 
OL,16,Fcampuses.                              
OL,18,FAccording to the college, the funds    
OL,19,Fwould support a range of improvements  
OL,20,Ffocusing on advanced manufacturing,    
OL,21,Fconstruction, computing and            
OL,22,Fprofessional and business services.    
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
