OL,3,GNEWSAWork to upgrade college facilities
OL,4,Aset to take place                      
OL,6,FIt added improvements were expected to 
OL,7,Fbe completed by mid-March 2027, with   
OL,8,Fwork planned during college holidays to
OL,9,Fminimise disruption to students.       
